@page "/support"
<PageTitle>Customer support — Kodon</PageTitle>
<PageHeader />
<section class="inner-page section-wrap"><div class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER SUPPORT</div><h1>We're here to help you <em>move forward.</em></h1><p class="page-lede">Find a quick answer or send our team a note. We typically respond within one business day.</p><div class="support-grid"><a href="/docs"><span>Browse documentation</span><small>Find setup guides, workflow examples, and billing answers.</small><b>↗</b></a><a href="mailto:support@kodon.ai"><span>Email support</span><small>support@kodon.ai</small><b>↗</b></a><div class="support-form"><label>Your email<input type="email" placeholder="you@company.com" /></label><label>How can we help?<textarea rows="4" placeholder="Tell us what you're working on..."></textarea></label><button class="button button-dark" type="button">Send message ↗</button></div></div><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU WRITE</div><h2>Bring the details that help us <em>help faster.</em></h2></div><p>Include the workspace, agent, and task you were working on, along with any error message or expected result. Please remove confidential client information from screenshots and examples.</p></div></section>
